t-card","ShuoListCard",". The generic ",[258,273,274],{},"T"," is the row type.",[277,278,280],"h2",{"id":279},"usage","Usage",[282,283,285],"h3",{"id":284},"loading-and-empty-data","Loading and empty data",[254,287,288,291,292,295],{},[258,289,290],{},"loading"," means a query is in progress. When re-querying with existing data, the data fades and switches with a height transition; without data, the query shows \"Loading…\". After the data is cleared, ",[258,293,294],{},"empty"," is shown, \"No data\" by default.",[297,298],"component-example",{"name":299},"table-basic",[254,301,302,303,306],{},"Keep the existing ",[258,304,305],{},"data"," while re-querying and update it after the query succeeds, so the data fades instead of being cleared.",[282,308,310],{"id":309},"first-load-skeleton","First-load skeleton",[254,312,313,314,316,317,320],{},"When the component is created while loading (",[258,315,290],{}," is ",[258,318,319],{},"true",") with no data, three skeleton rows are shown based on the number of columns; after the first query finishes, the skeleton is no longer shown. Press \"Recreate\" to recreate the table in the loading state.",[297,322],{"name":323},"table-skeleton",[254,325,326,327,330],{},"The skeleton column count uses leaf columns and excludes columns hidden by ",[258,328,329],{},"tableProps.state.columnVisibility",".",[282,332,334],{"id":333},"transition","Transition",[254,336,337,338,340,341,344],{},"When the row count or content height changes, the data area height changes smoothly over 0.2 seconds; when re-querying with existing data, the data fades to 0.5 opacity. With ",[258,339,333],{}," set to ",[258,342,343],{},"false",", the height follows the content directly and the fade has no transition. Nothing is animated when the user prefers reduced motion.",[297,346],{"name":347},"table-transition",[277,349,351],{"id":350},"examples","Examples",[282,353,355],{"id":354},"editable-table","Editable table",[254,357,358,359,330],{},"Put Shuo input components in cell slots, with a title and bottom buttons from ",[258,360,260],{},[297,362],{"name":363},"table-editable",[282,365,367],{"id":366},"detail-table-in-a-modal","Detail table in a modal",[254,369,370,371,374,375,378,379,382],{},"To limit the height and keep the header fixed, set ",[258,372,373],{},"ui.root"," and ",[258,376,377],{},"sticky"," through ",[258,380,381],{},"tableProps",", so the table itself scrolls and the header stays in place. The table is recreated each time the modal opens and shows skeleton rows while loading.",[297,384],{"name":385},"table-modal",[282,387,389],{"id":388},"disabling-actions-while-loading","Disabling actions while loading",[254,391,392,393,395,396,398],{},"Cell slots get an extra ",[258,394,264],{},", ",[258,397,319],{}," while loading, to disable buttons in the rows.",[297,400],{"name":401},"table-interaction",[282,403,405],{"id":404},"custom-loading-and-empty-content","Custom loading and empty content",[254,407,408,409,374,412,415,416,418],{},"Replace the built-in texts with ",[258,410,411],{},"#loading",[258,413,414],{},"#empty",". ",[258,417,411],{}," only shows when there is no data and it is not the first-load skeleton.",[297,420],{"name":421},"table-empty-slot",[277,423,425],{"id":424},"props","Props",[427,428],"component-props",{"name":429},"ShuoTable",[254,431,432,435,436,438,439,441,442,445],{},[258,433,434],{},"tableProps.paginationOptions.manualPagination"," is always ",[258,437,319],{},", with pagination handled by the back end; column visibility comes from ",[258,440,329],{},", and ",[258,443,444],{},"tableProps.columnVisibility"," passed directly has no effect.",[254,447,448,449,374,452,455,456,459,460,463],{},"\"Loading…\" and \"No data\" switch with the locale (\"查詢中…\" and \"查無資料\" in Traditional Chinese), and can be overridden globally with the ",[258,450,451],{},"table.loading",[258,453,454],{},"table.empty"," texts; see ",[267,457,47],{"href":458},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages",". Set